                        "content": "The nurse is monitoring a client with leukemia who is receiving doxorubicin by intravenous infusion. The nurse would monitor for which finding that would indicate doxorubicin toxicity?",
                        "subjectId": "ad5ab04c79144c0ea9b83385308c3b1d",
                        "difficultyIds": "11797937e327eb6d913faa80427c566b",
                        "difficulty": "考试范围-Analyzing 分析",
                        "textAnalysis": "Rationale:\nCardiotoxicity can occur with the use of doxorubicin. The medication can produce irreversible toxicity to the heart, including ECG changes and heart failure. Elevated values on renal function tests are not associated with the use of this medication. A red coloration of the urine may occur with the use of this medication, but this effect is harmless.",
                        "id": "10fef03e673549449d222fa920ffdc11",
                        "mark": "0",
                        "collectionState": "0"
                    },
                    {
                        "optionList": [
                            {
                                "isRight": "1",
                                "userAnswer": "",
                                "isSelected": "0",
                                "id": "3ecc7e9547e242c9bf978126ab4ee19e",
                                "content": "It is used to treat anemia."
                            },
                            {
                                "isRight": "0",
                                "userAnswer": "",
                                "isSelected": "0",
                                "id": "6f1d99d807e74931a0047344f0ea6533",
                                "content": "It is used to lower your blood pressure."
                            },
                            {
                                "isRight": "0",
                                "userAnswer": "",
                                "isSelected": "0",
                                "id": "23c726bf3c234f028052a42b627f2ad1",
                                "content": "It will help to increase the potassium level in your body."
                            },
                            {
                                "isRight": "0",
                                "userAnswer": "",
                                "isSelected": "0",
                                "id": "021cffcfceaa45f78d3a74ac1d0739cb",
                                "content": "It is an anticonvulsant medication given to all clients after dialysis to prevent seizure activity."
                            }
                        ],
                        "extJson": {
                            "optionList": [
                                {
                                    "isRight": "1",
                                    "userAnswer": "",
                                    "isSelected": "0",
                                    "id": "3ecc7e9547e242c9bf978126ab4ee19e",
                                    "content": "It is used to treat anemia."
                                },
                                {
                                    "isRight": "0",
                                    "userAnswer": "",
                                    "isSelected": "0",
                                    "id": "6f1d99d807e74931a0047344f0ea6533",
                                    "content": "It is used to lower your blood pressure."
                                },
                                {
                                    "isRight": "0",
                                    "userAnswer": "",
                                    "isSelected": "0",
                                    "id": "23c726bf3c234f028052a42b627f2ad1",
                                    "content": "It will help to increase the potassium level in your body."
                                },
                                {
                                    "isRight": "0",
                                    "userAnswer": "",
                                    "isSelected": "0",
                                    "id": "021cffcfceaa45f78d3a74ac1d0739cb",
                                    "content": "It is an anticonvulsant medication given to all clients after dialysis to prevent seizure activity."
                                }
                            ]
