                        "content": "A client who has been diagnosed with breast cancer is to receive chemotherapy with both cisplatin and vincristine. The client asks the nurse why both medications must be given together. The nurse would explain to the client that the combination of two chemotherapeutic medications is used for which reason?",
                        "subjectId": "ad5ab04c79144c0ea9b83385308c3b1d",
                        "difficultyIds": "80db17ea97ed8fdcd1b6b9666390fca1",
                        "difficulty": "考试范围-Applying 应用",
                        "textAnalysis": "Rationale:\nCisplatin is an alkylating-like medication, and vincristine is a vinca alkaloid. Alkylating medications are cell-cycle nonspecific. Vinca alkaloids are cell-cycle specific and act on the M phase. Single-agent medication therapy seldom is used. Combinations of medications are used to increase the destruction of tumor cells.",
                        "id": "1be05cc9734840deb4f11fd0b90f92d1",
                        "mark": "0",
                        "collectionState": "0"
                    },
                    {
                        "optionList": [
                            {
                                "isRight": "1",
                                "userAnswer": "",
                                "isSelected": "0",
                                "id": "96219357a6494678bce86a92a05ab0e3",
                                "content": "Subcutaneously"
                            },
                            {
                                "isRight": "0",
                                "userAnswer": "",
                                "isSelected": "0",
                                "id": "c7d27be761c64cc1b513660bdb1a3d07",
                                "content": "Intramuscularly"
                            },
                            {
                                "isRight": "0",
                                "userAnswer": "",
                                "isSelected": "0",
                                "id": "b0cac80ba1954c548e04e1713617e610",
                                "content": "With a full glass of water"
                            },
                            {
                                "isRight": "0",
                                "userAnswer": "",
                                "isSelected": "0",
                                "id": "083a37f617c5412cb91a1d518a37247e",
                                "content": "Diluted in juice to enhance taste"
                            }
                        ],
                        "extJson": {
                            "optionList": [
                                {
                                    "isRight": "1",
                                    "userAnswer": "",
                                    "isSelected": "0",
                                    "id": "96219357a6494678bce86a92a05ab0e3",
                                    "content": "Subcutaneously"
                                },
                                {
                                    "isRight": "0",
